    },
    {
      "path": "pmworkspace-shared/references/pm-workbench-map.md",
      "contains": "## 端到端链路"
    },
    {
      "path": "pmworkspace-shared/references/pm-workbench-map.md",
      "contains": "## 共享状态字段"
    },
    {
      "path": "pmworkspace-shared/references/pm-workbench-map.md",
      "contains": "发现门槛是真源 `product-discovery-gate.md`"
    },
    {
      "path": "pmworkspace-shared/references/pm-workbench-map.md",
      "not_contains": "用户只需做什么"
    },
    {
      "path": "pmworkspace-shared/references/pm-workbench-map.md",
      "not_contains": "本轮只让用户补一个事实"
    }
  ]
